{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And I will take you to Me as a people.</b> At the standing at Mount Sinai." "<b>And you shall know.</b> Acknowledge and reflect that all this will come true, as in וִידַעְתֶּם הַיּוֹם, כִּי לֹא אֶת בְּנֵיכֶם (Deuteronomy 11:2)." "<b>That I am YHWH your Elohim who brings you out.</b> For since I am your Elohim, I attend to each of you in particular, and since I am now active in bringing you out, there is no doubt that I will do everything I have said."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:34.075290157Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}